Error [E0204]: `values` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> builtin_mut_receiver_uses_two_phase_reservation_3.jet:4:45
    |
  4 |     &values.sort_by((value: Int) -> value + values.len())
    |                                             ^^^^^^
 Why: While something is being changed through the write-access marker `&`, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: Pass the write-access marker `&` (`&values`) only once, or copy first with `~values`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
